# IT Specialist (System Analyst/Customer Support)

Department of Veterans Affairs

Deputy Assistant Secretary for Information and Technology

Office of Information & Technology (OIT) End User Services (EUS)

Apply

## Summary

The position is located within the Department of Veterans Affairs (DVA), Office of Information and Technology (OIT), Development, Security and Operations (DevSecOps), Enterprise Command Operations (ECO). Serve as a Senior IT Specialist for the Enterprise Service Desks' Account Management Team, and provide IT support for all IT infrastructures, mainframe systems, applications, and VA-wide hardware and software that ultimately affect the plans, goals, and effectiveness of VA nationwide.

## Summary

The position is located within the Department of Veterans Affairs (DVA), Office of Information and Technology (OIT), Development, Security and Operations (DevSecOps), Enterprise Command Operations (ECO). Serve as a Senior IT Specialist for the Enterprise Service Desks' Account Management Team, and provide IT support for all IT infrastructures, mainframe systems, applications, and VA-wide hardware and software that ultimately affect the plans, goals, and effectiveness of VA nationwide.

